{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_fe87500984834797b002c197","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"14:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"6452\">\n    <frame id=\"14:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"145\">\n      <text id=\"14:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"14:5\" name=\"Furniro — furniture store website\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"14:6\" name=\"Design a furniture e-commerce website: browse the range, open a product, add it to the cart, compare two sofas, check out, contact the store and read the blog. Desktop web, 1440 wide, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"50\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"14:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"257\" width=\"1312\" height=\"249\">\n      <text id=\"14:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"14:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 9 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in page order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii, elevation and the page grid, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button and a default Text Field. Design all other states, the header, the footer, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the logo, the photos, the social logos and the icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"198\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"14:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"554\" width=\"1312\" height=\"2925\">\n      <text id=\"14:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"14:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"14:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"2836\">\n        <frame id=\"14:14\" name=\"01_Home\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"676\">\n          <text id=\"14:15\" name=\"01_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"82\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"14:16\" name=\"Goal: Get a feel for the store and find products.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"14:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"14:18\" name=\"• Browse The Range: “Browse The Range” · “Find the right pieces for every room in your home.” · Dining · Living · Bedroom, each with its photo (Photo_Range_Dining, Photo_Range_Living, Photo_Range_Bedroom) • Footer: see DATA (Footer) • Header: Logo_Furniro · “Furniro” · navigation Home / Shop / About / Contact · current: Home · account (Icon_Account) · search (Icon_Search) · wishlist (Icon_Heart) · cart (Icon_Cart) • Hero: Photo_Hero · “New Arrival” · “Discover Our New Collection” · “Handcrafted sofas, chairs and tables for every room — explore our latest arrivals.” · “BUY NOW” • Inspiration: “50+ Beautiful rooms inspiration” · “Our designers have already made many beautiful room prototypes to inspire you.” · “Explore More” · room slides Photo_Inspiration_Inner_Peace, Photo_Inspiration_2, Photo_Inspiration_3 · current slide: “01 — Bed Room” · “Inner Peace” · open (Icon_Arrow_Right) · next (Icon_Chevron_Right) · slide indicator: 4 slides, current 1 • Our Products: “Our Products” · 8 product cards, each with photo, name, description, price, old price and badge where given (see DATA) · “Show More” • Product card hover: the Leviosa card is shown in its hover state with “Add to cart” · Share (Icon_Share) · Compare (Icon_Compare) · Like (Icon_Heart) • Share your setup: “Share your setup with” · “#FurniroFurniture” · Photo_Setup_1 – Photo_Setup_9\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"400\" />\n          <text id=\"14:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"526\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"14:20\" name=\"→ Shop (nav), BUY NOW, Show More → 02_Shop → any product card → 03_Product → Compare (hover card) → 05_Comparison → cart (header) → 06_Cart → Contact (nav) → 08_Contact\" x=\"24\" y=\"552\" width=\"596\" height=\"100\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"14:21\" name=\"02_Shop\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"536\">\n          <text id=\"14:22\" name=\"02_Shop\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"78\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"14:23\" name=\"Goal: Browse the full catalog.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"14:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"14:25\" name=\"• Features: High Quality · Warranty Protection · Free Shipping · 24 / 7 Support, each with icon and line (see DATA) • Footer: see DATA (Footer) • Header: Logo_Furniro · “Furniro” · navigation Home / Shop / About / Contact · current: Shop · account (Icon_Account) · search (Icon_Search) · wishlist (Icon_Heart) · cart (Icon_Cart) • Page title: Photo_Page_Banner · “Shop” · breadcrumb Home › Shop (Icon_Chevron_Right) • Pagination: 1 · 2 · 3 · “Next” · current: 1