ame is fine.\n\nAlso home slide indicators etc. are entry-only.\n\nAlright. Also need \"About\" nav → entry only (no link). Footer links: Home → 01, Shop → 02, About → none, Contact → 08; blog link: add \"Blog\" link in footer? The brief says 09_Blog needs an entry point \"link it from wherever you see fit (e.g. the footer)\". Footer Links column: Home · Shop · About · Contact — I could add \"Blog\" to footer Links column. The footer data says Links: Home · Shop · About · Contact exactly. Adding Blog would deviate from fixed copy. Hmm — \"Copy and data must match 'Fixed data' exactly.\" Adding a Blog link changes footer copy. Risky either way; the brief explicitly allows linking blog \"from wherever you see fit (e.g. the footer)\". I'll add \"Blog\" as an extra link under \"Links\" (after Contact) — the fixed data lists required content; adding one more nav entry is a judgment call the brief invites. I'll do it: Links: Home · Shop · About · Contact · Blog.\n\nAlso home \"Explore More\" → entry only. Range tiles → entry only.\n\nCart drawer buttons: Cart → 06, Checkout → 07, Comparison → 05, close icon → 03.\n\n06_Cart: product name \"Asgaard sofa\" → 03_Product; \"Check Out\" → 07_Checkout.\n05: \"View More\" → 02_Shop; both \"Add To Cart\" (under products) → 06_Cart.\n02: breadcrumb \"Home\" → 01_Home; product cards → 03_Product; hover card Compare → 05_Comparison; header Home → 01, cart → 06.\n03: breadcrumb Home → 01? Brief: \"Shop (breadcrumb) → 02_Shop\" — only Shop breadcrumb link required; I'll also wire breadcrumb Home → 01_Home (harmless, consistent with \"Home (nav or breadcrumb) → 01_Home\" pattern used on other frames; for 03 not listed but nav Home is on every header — header nav Home → 01_Home is implied by nav structure. I'll wire header nav items on all frames: Home → 01, Shop → 02, Contact → 08; cart icon → 06.)\n   - Related product cards → 03_Product (self-navigation; fine).\n07: \"Place order\" → entry only (no link; maybe no interaction).\n09: breadcrumb Home → 01, header nav.\n01: nav Shop → 02, BUY NOW → 02, Show More → 02, 8 product cards → 03, hover Compare → 05, header cart → 06, Contact → 08.\n04: buttons as above, close → 03.\n\nTotal interactions ~50. I'll write a wiring script with a helper `link(node, destId, nav)`.\n\nNow font styles check. Let me run a quick inspection of available Poppins styles and the Text Field internal structure, and the fill scaleMode of a photo component.\n\nOne more thing: photos' imagePaint — when I resize instance, if scaleMode is FILL it crops. Let me verify with one photo. Also check whether photo components have any children (Photo_Hero had none — vector? type COMPONENT with no children means it's likely a rectangle with image fill flattened as component). Fills of the component itself should show imagePaint.\n\nLet me run the inspection.","signature":"8660844c82d7446a83b45b9a"}],"id":"5eef041c-f2e6-4838-a1ef-437aa1f839af","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"92572047-04a5-47e6-987f-f20b31e0f66f","uuid":"968ff228-e574-4163-a4f0-aa68ded4984e","timestamp":"2026-11-01T19:19:02.478Z","thinking_duration_ms":286041}
