f instance: allowed (resize on instance child). I'll set input height 56 via child.resize? Instance children resizes are allowed as overrides. Let me keep 75 default? 75 is chunky. I'll try child resize to 56; if fails, keep.\n\nHmm — actually simpler: keep Text Field as designed (75-tall inputs) — visually fine, generous spacing, \"reusable components\" criterion satisfied.\n\nPlaceholder text color #9F9F9F (0.62 gray given) — matches my borderD #9F9F9F. \n\nCheckout: 2-col first/last name each ~340: instance width resize 340. OK.\n\nContact form: Your name, Email, Subject, Message: Message = taller: set Input child height 120.\n\nCountry/Region & Province: Text Field + trailing chevron icon? Add Icon_Chevron_Down absolute in input? Can't append into instance. Instead: place icon instance next to the field? Design: select-style field: I'll place Text Field instance (label \"Country / Region\", placeholder \"Sri Lanka\") and overlay a chevron icon on top (absolute positioned over the input area in the page frame — icon at field right edge minus padding). Overlay works since it's added to the page-level container. Good.\n\nFor radio buttons (payment), qty steppers, size chips, color dots: custom small elements inline.\n\nPageBanner master (316 tall) — title/breadcrumb centered:\n```js\nconst B = figma.createComponent(); name \"PageBanner\"; ws.appendChild; resize(1440,316);\nB.fills=[hex(\"FBF1E7\")]; B.clipsContent=true;\nconst ph = await comp(\"13:16\"); ph.resize(1440,316); ph.name=\"BannerPhoto\"; B.appendChild(ph); ph.x=0; ph.y=0;\nconst ov = figma.createRectangle(); ov.resize(1440,316); ov.fills=[hex(\"FFFFFF\",0.35)]; B.appendChild(ov); ov.x=0;ov.y=0; ov.name=\"Overlay\";\nconst col = autolayout(\"Content\",\"VERTICAL\",12,0,0,0,0,B); col.counterAxisAlignItems=\"CENTER\";\ncol.x = (1440-?)... \n```\nPositioning col centered: after creation, set col.x = 720 - col.width/2, col.y = 316/2 - col.height/2. Since autolayout AUTO sizes, compute after adding children.\ntitle = txt(\"Shop\",\"SemiBold\",48,\"24252B\"); name it \"Title\"; breadcrumb row: gap 10 center: \"Home\" (Medium 16 dark) name \"Crumb Home\", icon chevron 20 dark, page txt \"Shop\" Regular 16 dark name \"Crumb Page\".\n\nWait — title on Shop banner original is \"Shop\" 48. OK.\n\nProductCard: photo swap concern: inner photo inst default Syltherine; on hover master: Leviosa.\n\nBadge default: hidden; text \"-30%\"; fill sale. Instances: for badge use: set badge.visible=true, badge.children[0].characters=..., badge.fills=[hex(...)] (fill on frame child of instance = override OK), text fill white stays.\n\nAlso ProductCardHover: no badge; overlay + Add to cart + actions.\n\nNames of overridable texts: \"Name\",\"Description\",\"Price\",\"Old Price\".\n\nOld price hidden default? Syltherine HAS old price (Rs. 3,500,000.00). Keep visible default; hide on Leviosa/Grifo/Muggo instances.\n\nPagination master: circles 44×44 radius 22? Original: circles. radius 22 (full round). current \"1\": bg brand white text; \"2\",\"3\": bg #F9F1E7 text dark; \"Next\": text Medium 14 dark no bg. Component name \"Pagination\".\n\nBlogPostCard: as sketched; meta icons 18 gray; width: photo 250 + content 520 = 802 + gap 32 = 834. Sidebar 320 + gap 60 → total 1214; content margin 60 → 834 + 60 + 320 = 1214 ≤ 1320 ✓. Actually content col width 520 fixed via text width 520; title/excerpt textAutoResize HEIGHT with w 520.\n\nAlright, also the reactions test — do it first in call 2, and also try alternate shapes. If reactions works, note for wiring phase.\n\nLet me also handle: `swapComponent` availability test in call 2 (on a temp instance).\n\nNow — code size. Call 2: test + Header + Footer. Let me write it.\n\nAlso for text nodes with width wrap: txt() with opts.w sets textAutoResize=\"HEIGHT\" then resize(w, t.height) — resize after setting autoResize HEIGHT: `t.resize(w, t.height)` OK.\n\nStrikethrough: textDecoration \"STRIKETHROUGH\".\n\nLet me write call 2 now. Also add letterSpacing defaults? Poppins fine as-is.\n\nOne concern: In `txt()`, setting fontName before characters requires font loaded — I load 4 styles at top.\n\nGo.","signature":"aa60c2f941584adc9168f2ef"}],"id":"9aa263f1-f917-4865-862e-0f2a0ca66215","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"92572047-04a5-47e6-987f-f20b31e0f66f","uuid":"387f3f4a-0178-4b25-a6fb-4228a90cbaa3","timestamp":"2026-11-01T19:22:37.332Z","thinking_duration_ms":195038}
