d ({type:\"ON_CLICK\"} didn't produce trigger errors — good; error only about action).\n\nLet me test the corrected shape now, and continue building remaining masters (FeatureStrip, PageBanner, ProductCard, ProductCardHover, Pagination, BlogPostCard) in the same call.\n\nAlso record: Header id = 19:4, Footer id = 19:22, footerH = 478, swapComponent works.\n\nNow build remaining masters. ProductCard details:\n\n```js\nconst PC = figma.createComponent(); name \"Product Card\"; ws.appendChild; x=3300,y=760;\nPC.layoutMode=\"VERTICAL\"; PC.resize(300,100); PC.primaryAxisSizingMode=\"AUTO\"; PC.counterAxisSizingMode=\"FIXED\"; PC.itemSpacing=0; PC.fills=[hex(\"FFFFFF\")];\nconst pw = frame(\"PhotoWrap\",300,280,PC); pw.fills=[hex(\"F4F3EF\")]; pw.clipsContent=true; // plain frame child of AL component: OK\nconst ph = await comp(\"13:21\"); ph.resize(300,280); ph.name=\"Photo\"; pw.appendChild(ph); ph.x=0; ph.y=0;\nconst badge = frame(\"Badge\",48,48,pw); badge.x=236; badge.y=16; badge.cornerRadius=8; badge.fills=[hex(\"E97132\")]; badge.visible=false;\nconst bt = txt(\"-30%\",\"SemiBold\",14,\"FFFFFF\"); badge.appendChild(bt); bt.name=\"BadgeLabel\"; bt.x=(48-bt.width)/2; bt.y=(48-bt.height)/2;\nconst ta = autolayout(\"Info\",\"VERTICAL\",6,24,24,28,24,PC);\nconst nm = txt(\"Syltherine\",\"SemiBold\",22,\"24252B\"); nm.name=\"Name\"; ta.appendChild(nm);\nconst ds = txt(\"Stylish cafe chair\",\"Medium\",15,\"898989\"); ds.name=\"Description\"; ta.appendChild(ds);\nconst pr = autolayout(\"PriceRow\",\"HORIZONTAL\",16,10,0,0,0,ta); pr.counterAxisAlignItems=\"BASELINE\"? \n```\nauto-layout counterAxisAlignItems \"BASELINE\" — valid for horizontal. Use \"CENTER\" to be safe.\n```js\nconst p1 = txt(\"Rs. 2,500,000.00\",\"SemiBold\",20,\"24252B\"); p1.name=\"Price\"; pr.appendChild(p1);\nconst p2 = txt(\"Rs. 3,500,000.00\",\"Regular\",16,\"B0B0B0\"); p2.name=\"OldPrice\"; p2.textDecoration=\"STRIKETHROUGH\"; pr.appendChild(p2);\n```\n\nProductCardHover: similar; PhotoWrap contains overlay:\n```js\nconst ov = frame(\"Overlay\",300,280,pw); ov.fills=[hex(\"24252B\",0.72)]; ov.x=0; ov.y=0;\nconst oc = autolayout(\"OverlayContent\",\"VERTICAL\",18,0,0,0,0,ov); center: oc.x=(300-w)/2; oc.y=(280-h)/2;\nconst add = frame(\"AddToCartBtn\",268,48,oc); add.fills=[hex(\"FFFFFF\")]; add.cornerRadius=2;\nconst at = txt(\"Add to cart\",\"SemiBold\",16,\"B88E2F\"); add.appendChild(at); at.x=(268-at.width)/2; at.y=(48-at.height)/2;\nconst acts = autolayout(\"Actions\",\"HORIZONTAL\",20,0,0,0,0,oc); center within overlay: acts.x=...\neach: autolayout H gap 8: icon 16 white + label 14 white.\n```\nPhoto for hover: Leviosa (13:17).\n\nPageBanner:\n```js\nconst PB = figma.createComponent(); \"PageBanner\"; resize(1440,316); clipsContent=true; fills=[hex(\"FBF1E7\")];\nconst ph = comp(\"13:16\"); ph.resize(1440,316); name \"BannerPhoto\"; append x0 y0.\nconst ov = rect 1440×316 fill white 0.3, name \"Overlay\", x0 y0.\nconst col = autolayout VERTICAL 12; append to PB; counterAxisAlignItems CENTER;\ntitle = txt(\"Shop\",\"SemiBold\",48,\"24252B\"); name \"Title\"; col.appendChild(title);\nconst bc = autolayout(\"Breadcrumb\",\"HORIZONTAL\",10,0,0,0,0,col); bc.counterAxisAlignItems=\"CENTER\";\nconst ch = txt(\"Home\",\"Medium\",16,\"24252B\"); name \"CrumbHome\"; bc.append;\nicon chevron right 20 dark \"CrumbIcon\";\nconst pg = txt(\"Shop\",\"Regular\",16,\"24252B\"); name \"CrumbPage\"; bc.append;\ncol.x = 720 - col.width/2; col.y = 158 - col.height/2;\n```\nWait: after appending children, col auto-sizes; compute width. For title override later (e.g., \"Product Comparison\" wider) — col won't recenter automatically since x fixed. Overrides change width → mis-centered. Solution: make col full-width: set col counterAxisSizingMode FIXED w=1440, x=0, and children centered via counterAxisAlignItems=\"CENTER\". Then text override recenters automatically. col.layoutMode=\"VERTICAL\", resize(1440, colH), counterAxisSizingMode=\"FIXED\", primaryAxisSizingMode=\"AUTO\"