ry, option pickers, stepper, tabs, comparison table, cart table, drawer, order summary, forms, blog card, sidebar widgets, feature strip ⏎ • How photos are cropped and placed\nHow it is evaluated\nYour file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\n1. Checklist coverage per frame ⏎ 2. Data & copy accuracy ⏎ 3. Flow & prototype completeness ⏎ 4. Information hierarchy ⏎ 5. Visual quality & consistency of your own system ⏎ 6. Component reuse ⏎ 7. State design (current nav, card hover, selected options, current tab and page)\nDeliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 9 named frames, your components and the prototype."}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"f0283321-ba0b-4d3d-bf51-1b7b92a4de96"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"call_9c0a980ed77a4011be95992e","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
