{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a Figma product design benchmark: build the complete \"Furniro — furniture store website\" (desktop web, 1440 wide, light mode) inside page \"03 · Workspace\" (node **15:2**) of the assigned file https://www.figma.com/design/iREO0ZncSJq5Rg5HF95nYG/ (fileKey `iREO0ZncSJq5Rg5HF95nYG`). Requirements:\n   - Account confirmed: zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai (done via whoami earlier; \"Sensenova design\" plan, Full seat).\n   - Follow \"00 · Start Here\" brief exactly (full text re-dumped this session — see section 3); use \"01 · Foundations\" rules (brand #B88E2F + Poppins FIXED; all else designer-defined consistently); reuse \"02 · Components\" (Button 1:23, Text Field 1:26) and \"04 · Media\" assets (all component IDs catalogued).\n   - Build exactly 9 frames named exactly: 01_Home, 02_Shop, 03_Product, 04_Cart_Drawer, 05_Comparison, 06_Cart, 07_Checkout, 08_Contact, 09_Blog (one state per frame), wired as clickable prototype with the listed links. Copy/data verbatim from \"Fixed data\". Header, footer, navigation and every business component as reusable components. Frame names fixed; must-include lists state WHAT not layout.\n   - Preserve all reference pages (00/01/02/04) and their nodes; keep unrelated content intact; do NOT create a different file or switch accounts.\n   - Before EVERY tool call include a visible decision summary prefixed exactly `Reasoning summary:`; after each tool result do the same; final response starts with `Reasoning summary: ...` then `Final answer:` with the assigned file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, remaining limitations.\n   - Inspect screenshots of all screens, fix visible problems, finish screens/states/prototype flows before final answer. Unattended session — resolve routine choices using the brief.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - `mcp__figma__use_figma` JS execution (50k char limit, no persistent state — helpers redefined every call; failed calls leave partial state, NO rollback)\n   - **Prototype wiring (CONFIRMED WORKING)**: `node.reactions = [{trigger:{type:\"ON_CLICK\"}, actions:[{type:\"NODE\", destinationId:\"<frameId>\", navigation:\"NAVIGATE\", transition:{type:\"DISSOLVE\", duration:0.3, easing:{type:\"LINEAR\"}}}]}]` — plural `actions` array inside the reaction object is REQUIRED (singular `action` triggers deprecation guard \"Please update the `actions` field\"); easing MUST be `{type:\"LINEAR\"}` (EASE_IN_OUT rejected); `node.actions` property does NOT exist; BACK = `{actions:[{type:\"BACK\"}]}`; valid action types: CONDITIONAL, BACK|CLOSE, URL, UPDATE_MEDIA_RUNTIME, SET_VARIABLE, SET_VARIABLE_MODE, NODE\n   - **Invisible master nodes are ABSENT from instance subtrees** (findOne/findAll/children don't see them) — nodes that need per-instance visibility toggling must be visible=true in the master, then hidden via instance override\n   - **Nested instance restrictions**: cannot set x/y (relative-transform) on an instance child inside an instance; `resize()` and `swapComponent()` DO work on nested instances\n   - `InstanceNode.swapComponent(componentNode)` swaps photo instances in place preserving node; re-find nodes after swap if needed\n   - Poppins styles: \"SemiBold\" (no space), \"Bold\", \"Medium\", \"Regular\" — loadFontAsync required before text work\n   - Photo media components have IMAGE fill scaleMode FILL — resize crops automatically\n   - Frames built as auto-layout VERTICAL pages (counterAxisSizingMode FIXED, primaryAxisSizingMode AUTO) stacking header/sections/footer instances\n   - get_screenshot returns URL+curl or base64 (enableBase64Response:true); maxDimension caps longer edge\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - **Figma file iREO0ZncSJq5Rg5HF95nYG** — pages: 0:1 \"00 · Start Here\", 1:2 \"01 · Foundations\", 1:3 \"02 · Components\", 1:4 \"04 · Media\", 15:2 \"03 · Workspace\" (build target).\n   - **Complete verbatim brief (dumped from 0:1 this session)** — key content:\n     - 01_Home MUST INCLUDE: Browse The Range (\"Browse The Range\" · \"Find the right pieces for every room in your home.\" · Dining/Living/Bedroom with Photo_Range_Dining 13:23, Photo_Range_Living 13:24, Photo_Range_Bedroom 13:22); Footer; Header (current: Home); Hero (Photo_Hero 13:9 · \"New Arrival\" · \"Discover Our New Collection\" · \"Handcrafted sofas, chairs and tables for every room — explore our latest arrivals.\" · \"BUY NOW\"); Inspiration (\"50+ Beautiful rooms inspiration\" · \"Our designers have already made many beautiful room prototypes to inspire you.\" · \"Explore More\" · slides Photo_Inspiration_Inner_Peace 13:12, Photo_Inspiration_2 13:10, Photo_Inspiration_3 13:11 · current slide \"01 — Bed Room\" · \"Inner Peace\" · open Icon_Arrow_Right 13:49 · next Icon_Chevron_Right 13:46 · slide indicator 4 slides current 1); Our Products (8 cards + \"Show More\"; Leviosa card in hover state with \"Add to cart\"·Share Icon_Share 13:51·Compare Icon_Compare 13:47·Like Icon_Heart 13:53); Share your setup (\"Share your setup with\" · \"#FurniroFurniture\" · Photo_Setup_1–9 = 13:69,13:72,13:58,13:70,13:59,13:60,13:61,13:62,13:63). LINKS: Shop nav/BUY NOW/Show More→02, any product card→03, Compare(hover)→05, cart(header)→06, Contact nav→08.\n     - 02_Shop: Features strip; Header (current: Shop); Page title Photo_Page_Banner 13:16 · \"Shop\" · breadcrumb Home›Shop; Pagination 1·2·3·\"Next\" current 1; 16 cards (8 products then same 8 again; FIRST Leviosa card in hover state); Toolbar: Filter Icon_Filter 13:50 · grid Icon_Grid 13:48 · list Icon_View_List 13:34 · current grid · \"Showing 1–16 of 32 results\" · \"Show\" 16 · \"Sort by\" Default Icon_Chevron_Down 13:30. LINKS: product card→03, Compare→05, Home nav/breadcrumb→01, cart→06.\n     - 03_Product: Breadcrumb Home›Shop›Asgaard sofa; Description tabs Description·Additional Information·Reviews [204] current Description + description text + Photo_Cloud_Sofa_1 13:7 + Photo_Cloud_Sofa_2 13:8; Gallery main Photo_Asgaard_Sofa 13:4 + thumbs Photo_Outdoor_Sofa_Set 13:14, Photo_Outdoor_Sofa_Set_Alt 13:15, Photo_Stuart_Sofa 13:64, Photo_Maya_Sofa 13:13; Header current Shop; Meta SKU SS001 · Category Sofas · Tags Sofa, Chair, Home, Shop · Share Logo_Facebook 13:44, Logo_LinkedIn 13:35, Logo_Twitter 13:36; Options Size L·XL·XS selected L · Color purple #816DFA, black #000000, gold #B88E2F; Purchase quantity − 1 + · \"Add To Cart\" · \"+ Compare\"; Rating 4.7 (Icon_Star 13:31, Icon_Star_Half 13:52) · \"204 Customer Reviews\"; Related Products: Syltherine·Leviosa·Lolito·Respira cards · \"Show More\"; Summary \"Asgaard sofa\" · Rs. 250,000.00 · short description. LINKS: Add To Cart→04, + Compare→05, Shop breadcrumb→02, related cards→03.\n     - 04_Cart_Drawer: Behind drawer = 03_Product page inactive; drawer \"Shopping Cart\" · close Icon_Cart_Close 13:39 · item Photo_Asgaard_Sofa · \"Asgaard sofa\" · 1 × Rs. 250,000.00 · remove Icon_Remove 13:43 · \"Subtotal\" Rs. 250,000.00; actions \"Cart\"·\"Checkout\"·\"Comparison\". LINKS: Cart→06, Checkout→07, Comparison→05, close→03.\n     - 05_Comparison: \"Add A Product\" · \"Choose a Product\" (Icon_Chevron_Down); Compared: Asgaard Sofa Rs. 250,000.00 · 4.7 · 204 Review | Outdoor Sofa Set Rs. 224,000.00 · 4.2 · 145 Review; Features; Header (no current); Intro \"Go to Product page for more Products\" · \"View More\"; Page title \"Product Comparison\" · breadcrumb Home›Comparison; Specs groups General·Product·Dimensions·Warranty one value per product per row · \"Add To Cart\" under each product. LINKS: View More→02, Add To Cart→06. (Full spec values in prior data: General —