sofas in its class, the Asgaard is a compact, sturdy three-seater with a solid-wood frame and deep, soft cushions.\" ¶1: \"Embodying the relaxed, honest spirit of Scandinavian design, the Asgaard pairs a solid-wood frame with soft, hard-wearing upholstery, built to be lived on every day.\" ¶2: \"Weighing in at 45 kg, the Asgaard is sturdy without being bulky. Its high-density foam cushions keep their shape, the removable covers are easy to care for, and the low, clean silhouette fits a small apartment as comfortably as a large living room.\"\n     - Footer (all frames): \"Furniro.\" · 400 University Drive Suite 200, Coral Gables, FL 33134 USA · Links: Home·Shop·About·Contact · Help: Payment Options·Returns·Privacy Policies · Newsletter \"Enter Your Email Address\"·\"SUBSCRIBE\" · \"2023 Furniro. All rights reserved\".\n     - Features strip: High Quality·crafted from top materials (Icon_Trophy 13:38); Warranty Protection·Over 2 years (Icon_Guarantee 13:42); Free Shipping·Order over Rs. 150,000 (Icon_Shipping 13:25); 24 / 7 Support·Dedicated support (Icon_Support 13:41).\n   - **Component masters on 03 · Workspace (15:2)**: Header **19:4** (1440×88; texts Nav_Home/Nav_Shop/Nav_About/Nav_Contact; icons Icon_Account 13:33/Icon_Search 13:40/Icon_Heart 13:53/Icon_Cart 13:26; Logo_Furniro 13:3); Footer **19:22** (h478; Link_Home/Link_Shop/Link_About/Link_Contact/Link_Blog texts; newsletter; copyright); FeatureStrip **20:4** (1440×280, bg #FBF1E7, SPACE_BETWEEN, 4 items icon 52 + SemiBold 18 title + Regular 13 sub); PageBanner **20:29** (1440×316; BannerPhoto 13:16 + white 0.35 overlay + centered Content col with \"Title\" SemiBold 48 + Breadcrumb [CrumbHome Medium 16, CrumbIcon 13:46 18, CrumbPage Regular 16]; override Title/CrumbPage); Product Card **20:39** (300 wide; PhotoWrap 300×280 bg #F4F3EF with Photo instance 13:21 + Badge 48×48 r8 visible=true with BadgeLabel \"-30%\"; Info: Name SemiBold 22, Description Medium 15 #898989, PriceRow [Price SemiBold 20, OldPrice Regular 16 #B0B0B0 strikethrough]; h434); Product Card Hover **20:50** (same but Photo=13:17 Leviosa + Overlay rgba(36,37,43,0.66) with OverlayContent [AddToCartBtn 268×48 white r2 \"Add to cart\" SemiBold 16 #B88E2F + Actions Share/Compare/Like rows white]; no OldPrice); Pagination **20:75** (Pg_1 active brand circle 44, Pg_2/Pg_3 #FBF1E7, Pg_Next); Blog Post Card **20:84** (H gap 32; PhotoWrap 250×250 r12 + Photo 13:5; Meta rows Icon_User+Admin, Icon_Calendar+\"14 Oct 2022\", Icon_Tag+Category; Title SemiBold 22 w520 lh32; Excerpt Regular 14 #898989 lh22 w520; ReadMore underlined; h250).\n   - **Frame built**: 01_Home **28:2** (h5177, x=0 y=0) — header (Nav_Home #B88E2F), Hero (cream #FBF1E7, text col + Button 1:23 instance \"BUY NOW\" + HeroPhoto 520×470 topLeftRadius 100), BrowseRange, OurProducts (Row1: Syltherine card + Leviosa HOVER instance + Lolito + Respira; Row2: Grifo/Muggo/Pingky/Potty; ShowMore 245×56), Inspiration (SlideMain 394×560, Slide2/3 198×260, InfoCard 380×560 with InfoCol + CurrentSlide \"01 — Bed Room\"/\"Inner Peace\" + ArrowOpen 48 brand + ArrowNext 48 white/brand-stroke + 4 Dots), ShareSetup (2 rows: widths [270,340,270,380] and [216,270,260,250,240] h400 r8), Footer instance. Screenshot verified GOOD.\n   - **Helper functions (redefine EVERY call)**:\n```js\nfor (const s of [\"Regular\",\"Medium\",\"SemiBold\",\"Bold\"]) await figma.loadFontAsync({family:\"Poppins\",style:s});\nfunction hex(h,o){const n=parseInt(h,16);return {type:\"SOLID\",color:{r:((n>>16)&255)/255,g:((n>>8)&255)/255,b:(n&255)/255},opacity:o===undefined?1:o};}\nfunction txt(chars,style,size,colorHex,opts={}){const t=figma.createText();t.fontName={family:\"Poppins\",style};t.characters=chars;t.fontSize=size;t.fills=[hex(colorHex)];if(opts.ls!==undefined)t.letterSpacing={unit:\"PIXELS\",value:opts.ls};if(opts.lh)t.lineHeight={unit:\"PIXELS\",value:opts.lh};if(opts.deco)t.textDecoration=opts.deco;if(opts.w){t.textAutoResize=\"HEIGHT\";t.resize(opts.w,t.height);}if(opts.align)t.textAlignHorizontal=opts.align;return t;}\nfunction autolayout(name,dir,gap,pT,pR,pB,pL,parent){const f=figma.createFrame();f.name=name;f.layoutMode=dir;f.itemSpacing=gap;f.paddingTop=pT;f.paddingRight=pR;f.paddingBottom=pB;f.paddingLeft=pL;f.primaryAxisSizingMode=\"AUTO\";f.counterAxisSizingMode=\"AUTO\";f.fills=[];if(parent)parent.appendChild(f);return f;}\nfunction frame(name,w,h,parent,x,y){const f=figma.createFrame();f.name=name;if(w)f.resize(w,h);if(parent)parent.appendChild(f);if(x!==undefined)f.x=x;if(y!==undefined)f.y=y;return f;}\nasync function comp(id){return (await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id)).createInstance();}\nasync function icon(id,size,colorHex,parent,name){const c=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);const i=c.createInstance();i.resize(size,size*(c.height/c.width));i.name=name;if(colorHex){for(const d of i.findAll(n=>[\"VECTOR\",\"BOOLEAN_OPERATION\",\"TEXT\",\"RECTANGLE\"].includes(n.type))){if(\"fills\" in d){try{d.fills=[hex(colorHex)];}catch(e){}}}}if(parent)parent.appendChild(i);return i;}\nasync function photoFrame(parent,name,w,h,x,y,r,photoId){const f=frame(name,w,h,parent,x,y);f.fills=[hex(\"F4F3EF\")];f.clipsContent=true;if(r)f.cornerRadius=r;const p=(await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(photoId)).createInstance();f.appendChild(p);p.resize(w,h);return f;}\nconst PRODS = [[\"Syltherine\",\"Stylish cafe chair\",\"Rs. 2,500,000.00\",\"Rs. 3,500,000.00\",\"-30%\",\"E97132\",\"13:21\"],[\"Leviosa\",\"Stylish cafe chair\",\"Rs. 2,500,000.00\",null,null,null,\"13:17\"],[\"Lolito\",\"Luxury big sofa\",\"Rs. 7,000,000.00\",\"Rs. 14,000,000.00\",\"-50%\",\"E97132\",\"13:18\"],[\"Respira\",\"Outdoor bar table and stool\",\"Rs. 500,000.00\",null,\"New\",\"2EC1AC\",\"13:20\"],[\"Grifo\",\"Night lamp\",\"Rs. 1,500,000.00\",null,null,null,\"13:73\"],[\"Muggo\",\"Small mug\",\"Rs. 150,000.00\",null,\"New\",\"2EC1AC\",\"13:19\"],[\"Pingky\",\"Cute bed set\",\"Rs. 7,000,000.00\",\"Rs. 14,000,000.00\",\"-50%\",\"E97132\",\"13:67\"],[\"Potty\",\"Minimalist flower pot\",\"Rs. 500,000.00\",null,\"New\",\"2EC1AC\",\"13:66\"]];\nasync function cardInst(data){const inst=(await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(\"20:39\")).createInstance();const ph=inst.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Photo\");await ph.swapComponent(await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(data[6]));ph.resize(300,280);inst.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Name\").characters=data[0];inst.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Description\").characters=data[1];inst.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Price\").characters=data[2];inst.findOne(n=>n.name===\"OldPrice\").characters=data[3]||\"\";const bd=inst.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Badge\");if(data[4]){bd.fills=[hex(data[5])];inst.findOne(n=>n.name===\"BadgeLabel\").characters=data[4];}else{bd.visible=false;}return inst;}\n```\n   - **Design system**: brand #B88E2F; cream #FBF1E7; card photo bg #F4F3EF; dark text #24252B; body #3A3A3A; gray #898989; light #B0B0B0; border #E5E5E5; input border #9F9F9F; sale badge #E97132; new badge #2EC1AC; footer bg #1F1F24; footer text #EFEFEF; star #FFC700; inactive pagination #FBF1E7. Type: hero 52 Bold; section title 40 SemiBold; banner 48 SemiBold; card title 22 SemiBold; price 20 SemiBold; body 16; nav 16 Medium. Primary btn = #B88E2F bg white text; secondary = white bg 1px #B88E2F border #B88E2F text.\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **reactions NODE action validation failures (multiple rounds)**: `{type:\"NODE\", destinationId, navigation:\"NAVIGATE\"}` → zod error listing valid types; adding `transition:{type:\"INSTANT\"}` → still fail; `{type:\"DISSOLVE\", duration:0.3}` → transition requires `easing` (DISSOLVE branch: \"Required value missing at transition.easing\"; directional branch needs MOVE_IN/MOVE_OUT/PUSH/SLIDE_IN/SLIDE_OUT + direction + matchLayers + easing); EASE_IN_OUT easing rejected; **LINEAR easing passed** but then hit guard \"Please update the `actions` field instead of the `action` field\"; `node.actions = [...]` → \"no such property 'actions' on FRAME node\"; **FINAL FIX: plural `actions` array INSIDE the reaction object** — `node.reactions = [{trigger:{type:\"ON_CLICK\"}, actions:[{type:\"NODE\", destinationId, navigation:\"NAVIGATE\", transition:{type:\"DISSOLVE\", duration:0.3, easing:{type:\"LINEAR\"}}}]}]` — verified OK with readback.\n   - **\"This property cannot be overridden in an instance: relative-transform\"**: setting `ph.x=0; ph.y=0` on the Photo instance nested inside a ProductCard instance. FIX: removed x/y set after swapComponent (position/size preserved by swap; resize allowed).\n   - **\"cannot set property 'visible' of null\"** in cardInst: Badge not found via findOne on instance. Diagnosis: master 20:39 has Badge with `visible=false`, and **Figma instance subtrees exclude invisible master nodes entirely**. FIX: set master Badge.visible=true; in cardInst, hide via `bd.visible=false` override for cards without badges.\n   - **frame() call bug**: `frame(\"InfoCard\",380,560,760,90)` passed number 760 as parent (would throw TypeError). FIX: `frame(\"InfoCard\",380,560,ins)` then set x/y.\n   - **Failed use_figma calls leave partial state**: orphaned instances created via createInstance (auto-appended to page) when cardInst threw mid-way. FIX: cleanup `for (const ch of [...ws.children]) if (ch.name===\"01_Home\" || ch.type===\"INSTANCE\") ch.remove();` before rebuilding; always remove same-named frame before rebuild.\n   - Info card bottom overlap risk (CurrentSlide vs arrows): repositioned cur.y=426, arrows y=492, dots y=512.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Prototype linking method fully solved after 5 iterative probe calls using temp frames and full error dumps.\n   - Master/instance override constraints mapped: invisible nodes absent from instances; nested instance transform locks; swapComponent works on nested photo instances.\n   - Full brief text re-dumped verbatim to guarantee copy accuracy (copy must match \"Fixed data\" exactly).\n   - 01_Home built and visually verified via screenshot: header current-nav gold, hero, range tiles, product grid with hover card + badges, inspiration slider card, setup gallery, footer — all render correctly.\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - (Prior session, from earlier summary) “请在以下Figma文件中完成完整设计：Figma 文件：https://www.figma.com/design/iREO0ZncSJq5Rg5HF95nYG/ 请先阅读「00·Start Here」中的设计任务，参考「01· Foundations」中的视觉规范，复用「02·Components」中的组件，使用「04·Media」中的素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。”\n   - (This session) Only the continuation system message instructing to resume from the summary without acknowledging it; no new human-authored messages. Standing constraints from benchmark setup: use only the assigned file; confirm account zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai; preserve reference pages; deliver in 03 · Workspace; report file URL, page ID, screen IDs, prototype work, limitations; `Reasoning summary:` before every tool call and `Final answer:` in the final response.\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - Build 02_Shop (id TBD, x=1600 y=0): header (Nav_Shop #B88E2F), PageBanner instance (Title=\"Shop\", CrumbPage=\"Shop\"), toolbar (Filter icon+text SemiBold 20 | \"Showing 1–16 of 32 results\" | Show 16 ⌄ | Sort by Default ⌄ | grid icon active #B88E2F + list icon), 16 cards in 4 rows of 4 in order Syltherine, Leviosa(HOVER instance 20:50), Lolito, Respira, Grifo, Muggo, Pingky, Potty, then the 8 again (Leviosa normal 2nd time), Pagination instance, FeatureStrip instance, Footer instance.\n   - Build 03_Product (x=0, y≈5600): header (Shop current), breadcrumb row Home›Shop›Asgaard sofa (no banner), gallery (main 13:4 ~550×530 + 4 thumbs 13:14/13:15/13:64/13:13), summary (name/price/rating stars+“204 Customer Reviews”/short desc/Size L·XL·XS selected L/colors purple #816DFA black gold with L and purple selected/quantity − 1 +/Add To Cart primary/+ Compare secondary/SKU SS001·Category Sofas·Tags Sofa, Chair, Home, Shop/social share logos), Description tabs (Description current underline/dark, Additional Information, Reviews [204]) with ¶1 ¶2 + Photo_Cloud_Sofa_1 13:7 + Photo_Cloud_Sofa_2 13:8 images, Related Products (Syltherine/Leviosa/Lolito/Respira card