hare row: \"Share\" label + 3 logo icons (13:44 facebook, 13:35 linkedin, 13:36 twitter) 24.\n- Description tabs section: tabs \"Description\" (current: dark + underline 2px), \"Additional Information\", \"Reviews [204]\" gray. Below: 2-col: left text ¶1 + ¶2 (Regular 14 lh24 #3A3A3A, width ~640), right: two images stacked/side: Photo_Cloud_Sofa_1 13:7 (445×320), Photo_Cloud_Sofa_2 13:8 (445×320). Reference design shows two images side by side on right. I'll do row of two 385×300 images.\n- Related Products: title SemiBold 40 centered? In reference \"Related Products\" centered. 4 cards: Syltherine, Leviosa, Lolito, Respira + Show More secondary button centered.\n- Footer.\n\nHeight estimate: 88 + 60 + ~640 + ~600 + ~700 + 478 ≈ 3100.\n\nPosition: 03_Product at x=1600, y=3600 (below 02_Shop at 1600,0 h3298 → y=3600 gap 302). Actually earlier plan said 03 at x=0 y≈5600 (below 01 h5177). Either fine. I'll place 03 at x=0, y=5400 (below 01_Home which ends 5177). \n\nBuild it.","signature":"f43641e7100b47d5a4fd75be"}],"id":"082b8ce1-97ac-4d18-b330-80a91e153fd4","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"92572047-04a5-47e6-987f-f20b31e0f66f","uuid":"04850056-59d4-47e6-be35-ce2e65bfe0c0","timestamp":"2026-11-01T19:43:39.149Z","thinking_duration_ms":19031}
