0000, United States\" (w for wrap: width 373 fixed on text via opts.w)\n    - card2: Phone: \"Mobile: +(84) 546-6789\" + \"Hotline: +(84) 456-6789\" two lines gap small → VERTICAL gap 6? Just two texts with lh.\n    - card3: Working Time: \"Monday–Friday: 9:00 – 22:00\" + \"Saturday–Sunday: 9:00 – 21:00\"\n  - formWrap VERTICAL gap 40 width 1240:\n    - row1 HORIZONTAL gap 60: field(name), field(email) each resize(590,111)\n    - subject instance resize(1240,111)\n    - messageWrap VERTICAL gap 10: label \"Message\" Medium 16 + custom box with placeholder text\n    - submit btn comp 1:23 \"Submit\" resize(180,56)? maybe 222×55. Use 180×56.\n- strip, footer.\n\nSet header nav colors: for all of Nav_Home/Shop/About/Contact set 000000, then Nav_Contact B88E2F.\n\nWait — in header master, is there a \"current page\" gold by default on Home? For 06 screenshot, no nav was gold — all black. So master default all black? Home screenshot had Nav_Home gold because I set override on that instance. So for 08 just set Nav_Contact gold. But to be safe set all four to 000000 then Contact to gold — deterministic either way.\n\nCleanup: remove existing 08_Contact.\n\nAlso need Icon ids: Icon_Location 13:29, Icon_Phone 13:32, Icon_Clock 13:54. From summary these were used in earlier plan and presumably verified from Media page. OK.\n\nIcons color: reference icons are dark outline. icon() with null keeps original fills. Pass null.\n\nCode it.","signature":"3f3643e7bc8145cf84e0dd9d"}],"id":"6f2942e0-f479-4ae2-8c07-33ae126b9802","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"92572047-04a5-47e6-987f-f20b31e0f66f","uuid":"bbcad945-09df-490c-a2d8-71258a0293b0","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:03:41.661Z","thinking_duration_ms":21172}
