0 | ZIP? no — classic: Town/City full width? Keep: Town / City 740\n  - Province select 740 \"Western Province\" + chevron\n  - row: ZIP code 350 | Phone 350\n  - Email address 740\n  - Additional information: label + custom textarea 740×180 empty (placeholder empty). Reference has empty additional info box. Label \"Additional information (optional)\"? Brief: Additional information. Use label \"Additional information\".\n  \nPayment section (left col continues): title \"Payment\" wait — payment is part of billing details column in reference. Structure:\n- \"Payment\" SemiBold 24? In classic Furniro, \"Payment\" heading then two radio options + descriptions. \n- Radio1: circle selected (brand dot) + \"Direct Bank Transfer\" SemiBold 16 + note text below (Regular 14 #898989, width ~700, the long bank text).\n- Radio2: circle unselected + \"Cash On Delivery\" SemiBold 16.\n- Privacy note: Regular 14 #000? with \"privacy policy\" underlined. width 740.\n- Place order button 1:23 \"Place order\" ~ 200×56.\n\nRadio circles: ellipse 20 with stroke #000; selected: inner dot brand 8? Simple: frame 20×20 cornerRadius 10 stroke 000 1px; selected has child dot 10 brand centered — plain frame absolute child at (5,5).\n\nRight col \"OrderSummary\" VERTICAL gap 24 width 440:\n- header row: \"Product\" SemiBold 20 | \"Subtotal\" SemiBold 20 (SPACE_BETWEEN, width 440)\n- divider\n- row: \"Asgaard sofa ×  1\" Regular 16 | \"Rs. 250,000.00\" Regular 16 #B0B0B0? Classic: item name + subtotal gray; then Subtotal row label + value gray; Total row gold bold.\n- \"Subtotal\" row: label + \"Rs. 250,000.00\" #B0B0B0\n- \"Total\" row: label SemiBold + \"Rs. 250,000.00\" SemiBold 20 gold.\nReference classic checkout right column has these rows.\n\nBanner Title=\"Checkout\", CrumbPage=\"Checkout\".\n\nLinks: Place order entry-only (no reaction). Breadcrumb Home → wired at master 20:29 level later.\n\ny placement: x=0 column has 01_Home (0..5177), 03_Product (y=5400..7945). So 07 at x=0, y=8200. 09_Blog at x=0 below: y=8200+h07+200.\n\nBuild now. Watch code size — moderate. Text Field instances: 10 fields. Let me count: First, Last, Company, Country, Street, Town, Province, ZIP, Phone, Email = 10 instances + 1 textarea.\n\nChevron overlay wrappers: create plain frame \"Select\" 740×111 fills=[] then append instance at (0,0) resized 740×111, then icon 13:30 size 20 dark at (740-36, 60)? Input box vertical center: instance height 111 = label 24 + gap 12 + input 75. Input spans y 36..111, center ~73. Icon y ≈ 63. x = 740-40.\n\nCode:\n\n```js\nasync function tf(parent,label,ph,w){\n  const inst = await comp(\"1:26\");\n  inst.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Label\").characters=label;\n  inst.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Placeholder\").characters=ph;\n  parent.appendChild(inst); inst.resize(w,111);\n  return inst;\n}\nasync function select(parent,label,val){\n  const wrap = frame(\"SelectField\",740,111,parent); wrap.fills=[];\n  const inst = await tf(wrap,label,val,740);\n  inst.x=0; inst.y=0;\n  const ch = await icon(\"13:30\",20,\"000000\",wrap,\"Icon_Chevron_Down\");\n  ch.x=740-40; ch.y=62;\n  return wrap;\n}\n```\n\nframe() appends to parent already. Good.\n\nRadio builder:\n\n```js\nfunction radio(parent,label,selected){\n  const row = autolayout(\"PaymentOption\",\"HORIZONTAL\",15,0,0,0,0,parent);\n  row.counterAxisAlignItems=\"CENTER\";\n  const c = frame(\"Radio\",20,20,row); c.cornerRadius=10; c.fills=[hex(\"FFFFFF\")]; c.strokes=[hex(\"000000\")]; c.strokeWeight=1;\n  if(selected){const d=frame(\"Dot\",10,10,c); d.cornerRadius=5; d.fills=[hex(\"B88E2F\")]; d.x=5; d.y=5;}\n  row.appendChild(txt(label,\"SemiBold\",16,\"000000\"));\n  return row;\n}\n```\n\nWait — appending row then c: c appended to row via frame(parent=row). OK. But c is fixed 20×20 in auto-layout row — fine.\n\nNote about \"cash on delivery\" option — plain.\n\nPrivacy text: mixed style — build two texts? Simpler: single text with underline on \"privacy policy\"? Mixed range styling: set characters then setRangeTextDecoration for the range. \n\n```js\nconst note = txt(\"Your personal data will be used to support your experience throughout this website, to manage access to your account, and for other purposes described in our privacy policy.\",\"Regular\",14,\"000000\",{w:740,lh:24});\nconst idx = note.characters.indexOf(\"privacy policy\");\nnote.setRangeTextDecoration(idx, idx+14, \"UNDERLINE\");\n```\n\nPayment note text (bank transfer description) Regular 14 #898989 w 700 lh 22, indented under radio (x offset 35): wrap in autolayout with padding L 35? Create VERTICAL gap 10 with paddingLeft 35.\n\nOrder summary right column:\n\n```js\nconst right = autolayout(\"OrderSummary\",\"VERTICAL\",0,0,0,0,0,main);\nright.resize(440,10); right.counterAxisSizingMode=\"FIXED\"; right.primaryAxisSizingMode=\"AUTO\";\nheadRow SPACE_BETWEEN width 440 padding B 20: Product / Subtotal SemiBold 20\ndivider 440×1\nitemRow SPACE_BETWEEN width 440 padding T 25 B 25: \"Asgaard sofa ×  1\" Regular 16 / \"Rs. 250,000.00\" Regular 16 #B0B0B0\nsubRow SPACE_BETWEEN padding B 15: Subtotal / Rs. 250,000.00 (#B0B0B0? label SemiBold? classic: label regular?) → label Regular 16, value Regular 16 #B0B0B0\ntotalRow SPACE_BETWEEN: Total SemiBold 16 / Rs. 250,000.00 SemiBold 20 gold\n```\n\nmain section: HORIZONTAL gap 60 padding T60 B80 L/R100, full width.\n\nLeft col resize(740,10): VERTICAL hug.\n\nSection: main.resize(1440,10) counter FIXED primary AUTO (HORIZONTAL: primary=width fixed 1440, counter=height AUTO). Children: left 740 + gap 60 + right 440 = 1240 = 1440-200. \n\nPlace order btn: resize(200,56).\n\nBuild.","signature":"63daaf106e4142fdba29e13d"}],"id":"2e081288-6c85-4519-a4a7-46306e4d5d8d","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"92572047-04a5-47e6-987f-f20b31e0f66f","uuid":"e8bc77c4-ef22-4d99-9862-ee8622bd78