{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a Figma product design benchmark: build the complete \"Furniro — furniture store website\" (desktop web, 1440 wide, light mode) inside page \"03 · Workspace\" (node **15:2**) of the assigned file https://www.figma.com/design/iREO0ZncSJq5Rg5HF95nYG/ (fileKey `iREO0ZncSJq5Rg5HF95nYG`). Requirements:\n   - Account confirmed: zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai (verified via whoami earlier).\n   - Follow \"00 · Start Here\" brief exactly; use \"01 · Foundations\" rules (brand #B88E2F + Poppins FIXED; all else designer-defined consistently); reuse \"02 · Components\" (Button 1:23, Text Field 1:26) and \"04 · Media\" assets.\n   - Build exactly 9 frames named exactly: 01_Home, 02_Shop, 03_Product, 04_Cart_Drawer, 05_Comparison, 06_Cart, 07_Checkout, 08_Contact, 09_Blog (one state per frame), wired as clickable prototype with the brief's listed links. Copy/data verbatim from \"Fixed data\". Header, footer, navigation and every business component as reusable components.\n   - Preserve all reference pages (00/01/02/04) and their nodes; keep unrelated content intact; do NOT create a different file or switch accounts.\n   - Before EVERY tool call include a visible decision summary prefixed exactly `Reasoning summary:`; after each tool result do the same; final response starts with `Reasoning summary: ...` then `Final answer:` with the assigned file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, remaining limitations.\n   - Inspect screenshots of all screens, fix visible problems; finish screens/states/prototype flows before final answer; never claim completion for unfinished work. Unattended session — resolve routine choices using the brief.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - `mcp__figma__use_figma` JS execution (50k char limit, no persistent state — helpers redefined every call; NO rollback on failure — cleanup pattern: remove same-named frame before rebuild).\n   - **Session handling**: after context compaction the old sessionId became invalid (\"Invalid sessionId. Retry this tool call without sessionId\") — omitting sessionId works and subsequent calls continue without it.\n   - **Stale-tree traversal quirk**: a findAll-based finder (btnOf) returned null for nodes that a subsequent identical read-only dump found — likely stale document tree in plugin context. Workaround: two-step pattern (findAll collect THEN filter) and, for wiring, prefer explicit node IDs obtained from a fresh read-only dump; use per-item try/catch or logging so one miss doesn't abort a batch.\n   - **Prototype reactions (CONFIRMED WORKING)**: `node.reactions=[{trigger:{type:\"ON_CLICK\"},actions:[{type:\"NODE\",destinationId:\"<frameId>\",navigation:\"NAVIGATE\",transition:{type:\"DISSOLVE\",duration:0.3,easing:{type:\"LINEAR\"}}}]}]`; BACK = `{trigger:{type:\"ON_CLICK\"},actions:[{type:\"BACK\"}]}`. Reactions set on COMPONENT masters propagate to all instances.\n   - **Text Field 1:26 behavior (probed)**: structure = Label (TEXT fs16) + Input (FRAME 453×75, white fill, 1px stroke #9F9F9F, cornerRadius 10) + Placeholder (TEXT fs16). Instance width stretches (Input follows); instance height does NOT stretch (Input vertical constraint MIN) → taller textareas must be custom frames mimicking the style (white fill, #9F9F9F stroke 1px, radius 10) with a Label text above. Cannot append children into instances → select chevrons done via plain wrapper frame containing instance + absolutely positioned icon.\n   - Font loading required before ANY text property write: `await figma.loadFontAsync({family:\"Poppins\",style:...})` for Regular/Medium/SemiBold/Bold.\n   - VERTICAL auto-layout: primary=height, counter=width; HORIZONTAL: primary=width, counter=height. `resize()` sets BOTH axes FIXED — after resizing, explicitly restore the hug axis. Full-width VERTICAL section: `f.resize(1440,10); f.counterAxisSizingMode=\"FIXED\"; f.primaryAxisSizingMode=\"AUTO\";` Full-width HORIZONTAL row: `f.resize(1440,10); f.primaryAxisSizingMode=\"FIXED\"; f.counterAxisSizingMode=\"AUTO\";`\n   - `setRangeTextDecoration(start,end,\"UNDERLINE\")` for mixed-style text (privacy policy link).\n   - Instance overrides: text `.characters` (font must be loaded), fills, visibility; `swapComponent()` on instance photo nodes (then re-resize); nested instance x/y not settable.\n   - get_screenshot with enableBase64Response:true returns inline image; maxDimension caps longer edge.\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - **Figma file iREO0ZncSJq5Rg5HF95nYG** — pages: 0:1 \"00 · Start Here\", 1:2 \"01 · Foundations\", 1:3 \"02 · Components\", 1:4 \"04 · Media\", 15:2 \"03 · Workspace\" (build target).\n   - **ALL 9 frames built and screenshot-verified (on 15:2)**:\n     - 01_Home **28:2** (x=0,y=0, h=5177) — header Nav_Home gold, hero (BUY NOW button = instance 28:30 in HeroText 28:26; ShowMore frame 28:159; ExploreMore 28:172 entry-only), BrowseRange, 8 product cards, ShowMore, Inspiration slider, ShareSetup, footer.\n     - 02_Shop **29:2** (x=1600,y=0, h=3298) — Nav_Shop gold, banner \"Shop\", toolbar, 16 cards, hover 20:50 at r0c1, pagination 20:75, strip, footer.\n     - 03_Product **31:2** (x=0,y=5400, h=2545) — Shop crumb text 31:29; Main 31:33 (Gallery 31:34 + Summary 31:46: AddToCart button instance **31:84**, CompareBtn frame **31:86** with \"+ Compare\" text 31:87); DescriptionSection 31:107 (Tabs 31:108, underline absolute); Related 31:122; footer.\n     - 04_Cart_Drawer **34:2** (x=1600,y=3600, 1440×1080) — CartDrawer 34:37: DrawerHeader 34:38, Items, BtnCart **34:58**, BtnCheckout **34:60**, BtnComparison **34:62**, close icon (name matches /close/i).\n     - 05_Comparison **37:2** (x=1600,y=4900, h=3014) — verified GOOD this session: Intro row (ViewMore frame **37:41**), ProdHead columns, ATCRow (ATC1 **37:79**, ATC2 **37:81**), 22 spec rows in 4 groups (General/Product/Dimensions/Warranty) with verbatim values, labels fixed w=290, strip, footer.\n     - 06_Cart **39:2** (x=1600,y=8100, h=1856) — header (no highlight), banner \"Cart\", CartSection (padding 80/100/40/100): HeadRow (Product 440/Price 240/Quantity 280/Subtotal 280 SemiBold 16), dividers #E5E5E5, ItemRow (photoFrame 13:4 100×100 + CartProductName \"Asgaard sofa\" Medium 16, price #898989, qty \"1\", subtotal gold SemiBold 16, Icon_Delete 13:28), TotalsWrap (primaryAxisAlignItems=\"MAX\") > CartTotals 390 wide (Cart Totals SemiBold 24, Subtotal row, Total row gold SemiBold 20, BtnCheckOut 1:23 instance 310×48), strip, footer. Screenshot GOOD.\n     - 07_Checkout **43:2** (x=0,y=8200, h=3210) — banner \"Checkout\"; CheckoutMain HORIZONTAL (740 + 60 + 440): BillingDetails left (First/Last 350 each, Company Name (Optional), Country/Region select \"Sri Lanka\", Street address, Town/City, Province select \"Western Province\", ZIP+Phone row, Email, Additional information custom textarea 740×160; Payment: radio Direct Bank Transfer selected (gold dot) + bank note (paddingLeft 35, w700 lh22), radio Cash On Delivery; privacy text w740 lh24 with \"privacy policy\" underlined via setRangeTextDecoration; BtnPlaceOrder 1:23 200×56); OrderSummary right 440 (Product/Subtotal head, divider, \"Asgaard sofa ×  1\" + Rs. 250,000.00 #B0B0B0, Subtotal row, Total gold SemiBold 20). Screenshot GOOD.\n     - 08_Contact **42:2** (x=1600,y=10150, h=2318) — Nav_Contact gold (all four nav texts explicitly set #000000 first, then Contact #B88E2F), banner \"Contact\", \"Get In Touch With Us\" SemiBold 36 + intro (#898989 w800 lh26), 3 info cards 373 wide (icons 13:29/13:32/13:54 size 44; Address \"236 5th SE Avenue, New York NY10000, United States\"; Phone \"Mobile: +(84) 546-6789\"/\"Hotline: +(84) 456-6789\"; Working Time \"Monday-Friday: 9:00 - 22:00\"/\"Saturday-Sunday: 9:00 - 21:00\"), form (Text Field instances: Your name/\"Abc\" 590, Email address/\"Abc@def.com\" 590, Subject/\"This is an optional\" 1240; Message custom box 1240×180 + placeholder \"Hi! I'd like to ask about\"), BtnSubmit 1:23 222×55, strip, footer. Screenshot GOOD.\n     - 09_Blog **45:2** (x=0,y=11610, h=2243) — banner \"Blog\"; Posts col (3 × BlogPostCard 20:84 instances: Photo swapComponent to 13:5/13:68/13:6 + resize(250,250), Category Wood/Handmade/Wood, Titles \"Going all-in with millennial design\"/\"Exploring new ways of decorating\"/\"Handmade pieces that took time to make\", verbatim excerpts); Sidebar 378 (SearchBox 378×56 stroke #9F9F9F radius 10 + Icon_Search 13:40 at (342,18); Categories SPACE_BETWEEN rows Crafts 2/Design 8/Handmade 7/Interior 1/Wood 6; RecentPosts 5 rows: thumbs 70×70 radius 8 photos 13:65/13:71/13:55/13:56/13:57 + titles Medium 16 w288 + \"03 Aug 2022\"); Pagination 20:75, strip, footer. Screenshot GOOD.\n   - **Component masters on 15:2**: Header 19:4 (Nav_Home/Nav_Shop/Nav_About/Nav_Contact texts; Icon_Account 13:33/Icon_Search 13:40/Icon_Heart 13:53/Icon_Cart 13:26); Footer 19:22 (Link_Home/Link_Shop/Link_About/Link_Contact/Link_Blog); FeatureStrip 20:4; PageBanner 20:29 (Title/CrumbHome/CrumbPage); Product Card 20:39 (Photo/Badge/Name/Description/Price/OldPrice); Product Card Hover 20:50 (AddToCart/Share/Compare/Like); Pagination 20:75; Blog Post Card 20:84 (PhotoWrap>Photo; Content>Meta[M_Author:Icon_User+Admin, M_Date:Icon_Calendar+\"14 Oct 2022\", M_Cat:Icon_Tag+Category], Title, Excerpt, ReadMore; native 802×250); Button 1:23 (single TEXT child); Text Field 1:26.\n   - **Helper functions (redefine EVERY call — canonical)**:\n```js\nfor (const s of [\"Regular\",\"Medium\",\"SemiBold\",\"Bold\"]) await figma.loadFontAsync({family:\"Poppins\",style:s});\nfunction hex(h,o){const n=parseInt(h,16);return {type:\"SOLID\",color:{r:((n>>16)&255)/255,g:((n>>8)&255)/255,b:(n&255)/255},opacity:o===undefined?1:o};}\nfunction txt(chars,style,size,colorHex,opts={}){const t=figma.createText();t.fontName={family:\"Poppins\",style};t.characters=chars;t.fontSize=size;t.fills=[hex(colorHex)];if(opts.ls!==undefined)t.letterSpacing={unit:\"PIXELS\",value:opts.ls};if(opts.lh)t.lineHeight={unit:\"PIXELS\",value:opts.lh};if(opts.deco)t.textDecoration=opts.deco;if(opts.w){t.textAutoResize=\"HEIGHT\";t.resize(opts.w,t.height);}if(opts.align)t.textAlignHorizontal=opts.align;return t;}\nfunction autolayout(name,dir,gap,pT,pR,pB,pL,parent){const f=figma.createFrame();f.name=name;f.layoutMode=dir;f.itemSpacing=gap;f.paddingTop=pT;f.paddingRight=pR;f.paddingBottom=pB;f.paddingLeft=pL;f.primaryAxisSizingMode=\"AUTO\";f.counterAxisSizingMode=\"AUTO\";f.fills=[];if(parent)parent.appendChild(f);return f;}\nfunction frame(name,w,h,parent,x,y){const f=figma.createFrame();f.name=name;if(w)f.resize(w,h);if(parent)parent.appendChild(f);if(x!==undefined)f.x=x;if(y!==undefined)f.y=y;return f;}\nasync function comp(id){return (await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id)).createInstance();}\nasync function icon(id,size,colorHex,parent,name){const c=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);const i=c.createInstance();i.resize(size,size*(c.height/c.width));i.name=name;if(colorHex){for(const d of i.findAll(n=>[\"VECTOR\",\"BOOLEAN_OPERATION\",\"TEXT\",\"RECTANGLE\"].includes(n.type))){if(\"fills\" in d){try{d.fills=[hex(colorHex)];}catch(e){}}}}if(parent)parent.appendChild(i);return i;}\nasync function photoFrame(parent,name,w,h,x,y,r,photoId){const f=frame(name,w,h,parent,x,y);f.fills=[hex(\"F4F3EF\")];f.clipsContent=true;if(r)f.cornerRadius=r;const p=(await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(photoId)).createInstance();f.appendChild(p);p.resize(w,h);return f;}\n```\n   Page frame creation: `F.layoutMode=\"VERTICAL\"; F.itemSpacing=0; F.resize(1440,1000); F.primaryAxisSizingMode=\"AUTO\"; F.counterAxisSizingMode=\"FIXED\"; F.fills=[hex(\"FFFFFF\")]; ws.appendChild(F); F.x=…; F.y=…;` with pre-cleanup `for (const c of [...ws.children]) if (c.name===\"NN_Name\") c.remove();`\n   - **Prototype wiring — COMPLETED (final map)**:\n     - Masters: Header 19:4 → Nav_Home→28:2, Nav_Shop→29:2, Nav_Contact→42:2, Icon_Cart→39:2; Footer 19:22 → Link_Home→28:2, Link_Blog→45:2 (Link_Shop/Contact/About unwired per brief); PageBanner 20:29 CrumbHome→28:2; ProductCard 20:39 root→31:2; Hover 20:50 Compare→37:2.\n     - Frames: 01: 28:30 (BUY NOW)→29:2, ShowMore (28:159)→29:2; 03: 31:84 (AddToCart)→34:2, CompareBtn→37:2, Shop crumb 31:29→29:2; 04: 34:58→39:2, 34:60→43:2, 34:62→37:2, close icon→BACK; 05: ViewMore 37:41→29:2, 37:79→39:2, 37:81→39:2; 06: BtnCheckOut→43:2, CartProductName→31:2; 07: Place order entry-only (no reaction); 08/09: breadcrumb Home via master. Explore More, About, account/search/wishlist icons, pagination, form fields, Submit, Subscribe, Read more, categories, recent posts, size/color/qty etc. all entry-only per brief.\n   - **Blog fixed data (verbatim, from 0:1 node 14:113/14:116)**: Post 1 \"Going all-in with millennial design\" · Wood — \"Soft pastels, rounded silhouettes and natural wood: how millennial design took over the living room, and how to make it feel personal rather than borrowed from a feed.\"; Post 2 \"Exploring new ways of decorating\" · Handmade — \"Moving one lamp can change a whole room. Simple ways to refresh your space with what you already own, plus a few handmade pieces that add character.\"; Post 3 \"Handmade pieces that took time to make\" · Wood — \"From hand-turned legs to woven seats: meet the makers behind some of our favourite pieces and learn why slow craftsmanship lasts longer.\"; all \"Admin · 14 Oct 2022\"; Categories Crafts 2 · Design 8 · Handmade 7 · Interior 1 · Wood 6; Recent Posts (all 03 Aug 2022): the 3 titles above + \"Modern home in Milan\" + \"Colorful office redesign\".\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **\"Invalid sessionId. Retry this tool call without 