er.\" All required screens, states, and prototype flows are finished; no further building is needed. If the overview screenshot shows no new problems, the final response should state completion with the 9 screen IDs (28:2, 29:2, 31:2, 34:2, 37:2, 39:2, 42:2, 43:2, 45:2), the completed prototype link map (as itemized in section 3), and the listed limitations.\n\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: /mnt/afs/huangxinyue/bench-runs/web10-main-v4-20261102/runs/TEST-031_1793560335630/claude-config/projects/-mnt-afs-huangxinyue-bench-runs-web10-main-v4-20261102-workspace/92572047-04a5-47e6-987f-f20b31e0f66f.jsonl\nContinue the conversation from where it left off without asking the user any further questions. Resume directly — do not acknowledge the summary, do not recap what was happening, do not preface with \"I'll continue\" or similar. Pick up the last task as if the break never happened.\n\nThe messages after this summary are the most recent messages from before compaction, kept verbatim. The summary was written without seeing them, so something it says has not happened yet may already have happened in them."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"92572047-04a5-47e6-987f-f20b31e0f66f","uuid":"a9df4a76-ff9c-4eb9-bb8f-b0bb25438fc8","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:14:58.414Z","isSynthetic":true}
